@startuml LMS_Arch_06_Detailed_Layered_MHCPMS
title Architecture 6: Detailed 4-Layer Architecture (MHC-PMS Analog)

skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #222222
  RoundCorner 6
}
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

rectangle "Layer 4: User Interface\nWeb Browser (Librarian & Student / Faculty / Staff Portal)" as L4 #E3F2FD

rectangle "Layer 3: UI & Security Services" as L3_Box #E8F5E9 {
  rectangle "Authentication & Login" as L3_1 #FFFFFF
  rectangle "Role-Based Access Control\n(Student / Faculty / Staff / Admin)" as L3_2 #FFFFFF
  rectangle "Form / Menu Management" as L3_3 #FFFFFF
  rectangle "Input Validation" as L3_4 #FFFFFF
}

rectangle "Layer 2: Core Business Services" as L2_Box #FFF9C4 {
  rectangle "Security & CSRF Protection" as L2_1 #FFFFFF
  rectangle "Catalog & Circulation Manager\n(Issue, Return, Renew, Reserve)" as L2_2 #FFFFFF
  rectangle "External Data Import / Export\n(API Fetch, CSV Upload/Export)" as L2_3 #FFFFFF
  rectangle "Reporting & Notification\n(Overdue Report, SMTP Alerts)" as L2_4 #FFFFFF
}

rectangle "Layer 1: System Infrastructure" as L1_Box #FCE4EC {
  rectangle "ACID Transaction Management" as L1_1 #FFFFFF
  rectangle "Relational Library Database (PostgreSQL / SQLite)" as L1_2 #FFFFFF
}

L4 -down-> L3_Box : User Events / HTTP Requests
L3_Box -down-> L2_Box : Validated Commands
L2_Box -down-> L1_Box : DB Operations / Transactions

note right of L2_Box
  **MHC-PMS Analog:**
  • Patient Info → Catalog & Circulation
  • Data Export → External API & CSV
  • Report Generator → Overdue & Popular
end note

@enduml
